<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">IBR ARUM</book>
  <para style="h">IBRANIYAWA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ibraniyawa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ibraniyawa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ibr</para>
  <para style="mt2">AMGBASHO BULUS A NA NA</para>
  <para style="mt1">IBRANIYAWA</para>
  <para style="imt">IKPI TSIFA</para>
  <para style="im" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HEB 1" />
  <para style="s1">Tsifa Nnoh Reh A bu Ma Aki Amehreh A ŋoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 1:1" />Na kiri reh Nnoh tana ka atsifa na Ada ambohroh mboh reh ma akeki atsetse lo vara ma aniye amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh reh, <verse eid="HEB 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 1:2" />nza ka a gu a ba ba a te na ameh trina amboh nehnehreh neh atsifa na ambohroh ma aki Amehreh a ŋoh. A bu ma aki Amehreh a ŋoh reh Nnoh nza a lisa awumu mboh nambri reh, a bu ŋoh za ata Nnoh nza a yi awumu mboh reh ata ma ivoh a ŋoh nambri. <verse eid="HEB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 1:3" />Ŋoh a bu zanana ata nza a tsana la Nnoh a bu agba tasa za a tsana a zizi Nnoh reh, a de awumu mboh reh nambri na wuwana ma atsi bleh tsifa a ŋoh. Neh ŋoh kǝ de aki hwara kpakpana kyangwri mboh reh nambri ba, a ka a na na a tuma na mgba ivoh rya a kpa Nnoh, ŋoh nza a bu agba nambri reh.<verse eid="HEB 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amehreh Nnoh a bu Agba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 1:4" />Nnoh reh a lisa Amehreh reh a keh mara tohmoh a ŋoh mboh reh, tswanza isa ata Nnoh nza a nga ŋoh reh a bu agba a keh amoh. <verse eid="HEB 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 1:5" />Nnoh reh a sohroh a bleh ma anyi nimeh; mara tohmoh a ŋoh mboh reh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">&lt;&lt;Ni bu Amehreh amya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">andrehmeh areh mya meh bu atsiyoh amohnoh.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:5">Tasa za,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">&lt;&lt;Meh nati bu alehmeh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">tasa za ŋoh a nati a bu amehreh amya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 1:6" />Tasa za, ameh ata Nnoh ta ka a nati a tohmoh amehreh jiji a ŋoh a ba inziyo reh, tana a bleh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:6">&lt;&lt;Mara tohmoh Nnoh mboh reh nambri mata a krumusu ŋoh za.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 1:7" />Ma ikpi mara tohmoh Nnoh mboh reh neh Nnoh a bleh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:7">Nnoh a lisa mara tohmoh a ŋoh mboh reh tswanza inyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:7">A lisa ahwra a ŋoh mboh reh a tswanza arimi shira.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:7">. <verse eid="HEB 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 1:8" />Ma ikpi Amehreh a ŋoh reh neh, Nnoh reh a bleh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:8">&lt;&lt;Kpra Agohmoh anzoh reh, Nnoh, a nati a tuma atono!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:8">Ni de kyangwri anzoh mboh reh ma aki alindeh.<verse eid="HEB 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 1:9" />Ni kira na andromboh ata nza a zohhoh tasa za ni leke na andromboh ata nza a bu abibi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:9">A bu tsifa wohroh Nnoh ata nza a bu Nnoh anzoh reh, a seh nnoh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">tasa za a nga noh johjoh ata nza a bu gaga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">ata nza a te agba a keh mgbiri ziza anzoh mboh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 1:10" />A gyuru a bleh za la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:10">&lt;&lt;Nnoh Ada, ta ka anyi jiji reh tini lisa inziyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:10">tasa za ni lisa avereh inza mboh reh na ivoh anzoh.<verse eid="HEB 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 1:11" />Ma a nati a lalana, nnoh neh ni nati yama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:11">ma a nati a te atono tswanza kuri mboh reh.<verse eid="HEB 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 1:12" />Ni nati gugunu mboh tswanza rishi reh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">ma a nati a sehneh mboh tswanza maka a sehneh kuri reh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:12">Nnoh neh ni nati sehnehna kpeh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">ahushi anzoh a nati a trina kpeh.<verse eid="HEB 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 1:13" />Nnoh reh a sohroh a bleh ma mara tohmoh a ŋoh mboh reh:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:13">&lt;&lt;Tuma ba na mgba ivoh rya a kpa amya areh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:13">meh nati fira amboh ata nza ma a fi noh ma tohmoh reh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:13">were ma inzi mata a bu kpra gya hwana anzoh mboh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 1:14" />Mboh mara tohmoh Nnoh mboh reh feh maka a bu anyi? Ma a bu huru amboh ata nza ma a te ndohmoh ma Nnoh tasa a bu ŋoh a tohmoh mboh la mata a shingi amboh ata Nnoh a nati a nga mboh nvara reh.<verse eid="HEB 1:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HEB 2" />
  <para style="s1">Nvara Agba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 2:1" />A bu tsifa wohroh reh, a zohhoh meh ti lisa de tsifa ata a zizi reh wuwa, la mata a landa reh kpeh. <verse eid="HEB 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 2:2" />Tsifa ata mara tohmoh Nnoh mboh nza ma a bleh Ada ambohroh mboh reh tana a bu zizi, tasa za akyo ata nza a leke sere tsifa mboh reh, ha ta a sa tsifa mboh reh a kira kpeh, ma a nati ahwra mboh akpi ata nza a tswa na amoh. <verse eid="HEB 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 2:3" />Nza ka a bu dehreh reh, meh nati lisa lele feh meh ti gbo nvara, nza Mbohroh meh leke sa nvara agba ata Ada na ikpi a ŋoh ta ka a jiji a bleh reh? amboh ata nza ma a sehreh tsifa Yeso reh ma a bleh reh a shimba la tsifa reh a bu zizi. <verse eid="HEB 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 2:4" />Nnoh na ikpi a ŋoh za a nza a bleh la andromboh ata kyangwri amboh areh nza ma a leh a bleh reh a bu zizi. Tana a lisa awumu ŋara aniye tasa agbugba awumu ata nza a tsana la ŋoh tana a bu na amoh, tana a shingi mboh za na ngǝnga ata Huru Zana na na kira a ŋoh.<verse eid="HEB 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ata Nza a jiji a tsana reh Aki Hunji Nvara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 2:5" />Inziyo afeh ata nza a nati a ba ata Mbohroh nza meh leh tsifa ma ikpi reh, Nnoh a sohroh a gya mara tohmoh a ŋoh mboh reh la mata a de inziyo reh kpeh. <verse eid="HEB 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 2:6" />Neh, tswanza nza a bu ŋa gyaa nimeh amgbasho Nnoh reh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:6">&lt;&lt;Kyangwri wusu a ka bu umbo? ata nnoh nza ni kohnoh na a ŋoh reh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:6">amehreh kyangwri za ata ni leh nza ŋoh?<verse eid="HEB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 2:7" />La ni lisa mboh ma anyinana shidi na mara tohmoh anzoh mboh reh;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:7">nnoh neh ni nga mboh agba tasa za ti rya mboh sa,<verse eid="HEB 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 2:8" />tasa za ni lisa mboh ma a de Agohmoh awumu mboh reh nambri.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:8">Ma a bleh la a bu Nnoh a lisa kyangwri mboh &lt;&lt; mata a de Agohmoh awumu mboh reh nambri&gt;&gt;; ata areh a mishi awumu mboh reh nambri. Mbohroh neh meh sohroh nza kyangwri mboh atsi de Agohmoh awumu mboh reh nambri kpeh nehnehreh. <verse eid="HEB 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 2:9" />Mbohroh neh meh leh nza Yeso, ata nza a yanda kpeh Nnoh a lisa ŋoh anyinana shidi na mara tohmoh a ŋoh mboh reh, tsifa la ma aki lisa alindeh Nnoh ŋoh ta a kwo tsifa kyangwri mboh nambri. nehnehreh meh nza ma nga ŋoh agba tasa rya sa tsifa la a wa iya ata kwo. <verse eid="HEB 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 2:10" />Tana a bu Yelele na Nnoh, ŋoh ata nza a lisa tasa za ta a sumu awumu mboh nambri reh, ta a lisa Yeso reh ta a bu Yelele ma aki wa iya a ŋoh reh, la mata a de vara amehreh mboh a ba atsi gafa agba a ŋoh reh. Yeso reh a bu ŋoh tsene ata nza a tsana mboh aki hunji nvara reh.<verse eid="HEB 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 2:11" />Yeso reh a hwara kyangwri mboh anyi ma kpakpana amoh mboh reh nambri, ŋoh na ikpi ma tasa amboh ata ŋoh nza a hwara mboh anyi ma kpakpana amoh mboh reh Ada amoh a bu anyimbehreh. Nza a bu dehreh Yeso a sohroh a kwo sa ta a fi kyangwri amboh wohroh la asra ha atsini mboh kpeh. <verse eid="HEB 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 2:12" />Tswanza nza ka a bleh ma Nnoh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:12">&lt;&lt;Meh nati bleh ma kyangwri amya mboh andromboh ata nnoh nza ni lisa reh; la ni bu agba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:12">Meh nati krumusu nnoh ma atsi ma hohroh kyangwri anzoh mboh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 2:13" />A gyuru a bleh za la, &lt;&lt;Meh nati gya agohsoh amya na ni Nnoh.&gt;&gt; Tasa a ka a gyuru a bleh za la, &lt;&lt;Nza mya uwe Mbohroh ma amehreh amboh ata Nnoh a nza nga meh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 2:14" />Nza ma a bu amehreh mboh Yeso nza a fi mboh reh, ma bu kyangwri na imya ta iwo ma itoh, Yeso na ikpi a ŋoh za a gu ikpi a ŋoh tswanza mboh reh nimeh itoh. A lisa dehreh tsifa la ma aki kwo a ŋoh reh mata a lofo na agugu reh, ŋoh nza a bu na wuwana ma ikpi kwo, <verse eid="HEB 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 2:15" />tasa za ma aki wohroh reh a hingre amboh ata nza ma a bu ahwra anyi avoh ameh reh tsifa la ma a nyiri kwo. <verse eid="HEB 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 2:16" />A bu zizi la Yeso reh a ba ta a shingi mara tohmoh mboh reh kpeh, a ba neh la ŋoh a shingi kyangwri amboh ata nza ma anyi ma alohsoh Ibrahim reh mi. <verse eid="HEB 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 2:17" />Ma ikpi tsifa ata areh, a zohhoh Yeso reh ta a gu ikpi a ŋoh tswanza kyangwri a ŋoh mboh reh ma akeki atsetse, la ŋoh ta a bu mboh agba Firist ata ka a lisa yehlehleh ma atsi te ndohmoh ma Nnoh reh, la ŋoh ta a te kohhroh na kpakpana kyangwri mboh. <verse eid="HEB 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 2:18" />nehnehreh ŋoh a nati a wina shingi amboh ata agugu nza a leh a tsara mboh reh, tsifa la ŋoh na ikpi a ŋoh za tama a tsara ŋoh tasa za tana a wa iya.<verse eid="HEB 2:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HEB 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yeso reh A keh Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 3:1" />Nza a bu dehreh ambohroh mboh amboh tufa mboh, mohnoh amboh ata nza ni hunji noh fi ata Nnoh reh! kohnoh nnoh ma ikpi Yeso ata ŋoh nza a bu kyangwri sa tohmoh nana tasa Firist agba ata ŋoh nza a bu na nga agohsoh ata Mbohroh nza meh nza timi bleh reh. <verse eid="HEB 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 3:2" />Tana nga agohsoh a ŋoh ma Nnoh, ata ŋoh nza a seh ŋoh ta a te ndohmoh reh, tswanza Musa ta ka nga agohsoh na ndohmoh a ŋoh nimeh ida Nnoh reh. <verse eid="HEB 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 3:3" />Kyangwri ata nza a mina afiya reh, ma a nati nga ŋoh agba a keh afiya ata ŋoh nza a mina reh. Ma aki wohroh za a zohhoh mata nga Yeso agba a keh Musa. <verse eid="HEB 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 3:4" />Afiya mboh reh a bu na akyo ata nza a mina mboh, a bu Nnoh neh a lisa awumu mboh reh nambri. <verse eid="HEB 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 3:5" />Musa reh tana a bu kyangwri lisa yehlehleh nimeh ida Nnoh tswanza ahwra, tasa za tana atsifa ma ikpi awumu amboh ata Nnoh nza a nati a bleh a ba ma tohmoh reh. <verse eid="HEB 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 3:6" />Kristi neh tana bu yehlehleh ma ikpi la ŋoh tana a bu amehreh ata nza ma a nga ŋoh wuwana ma ikpi ida Nnoh reh, a bu Mbohroh nza meh bu afiya a ŋoh mboh reh, nza Mbohroh meh leh rya tohmoh na wuwa agohsoh, meh ti gyuru gya agohsoh ambohroh na awumu amboh ata nza meh leh gya agohsoh ma ikpi reh.<verse eid="HEB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Fo Ata Nza A bu Kyangwri Nnoh Mboh Amoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 3:7" />Nza a bu dehreh, tswanza Huru zanana nza a bleh reh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:7">&lt;&lt;Nza ni sere agba Nnoh reh andrehmeh,<verse eid="HEB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 3:8" />kama wuwa nnoh ikpi kpeh, tswanza atsiyoh amohnoh mboh na kiri ta maka a wuwa ikpi ma atsi leke Nnoh reh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:8">tswanza ma ta ka a bu ibi ata ma ta ka a tsara ŋoh a nza ma inzi a tuhwara reh.<verse eid="HEB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 3:9" />Nnoh reh a bleh la, ma a huru atsiyoh amohnoh mboh na kiri reh tama a leh a tsara meh a nza.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:9">mboh neh tama a nza andromboh ata meh ti kǝ lisa nimeh ahushi agrumavoh ida aniye reh.<verse eid="HEB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 3:10" />A bu tsifa wohroh meh tini te gofo na kyangwri amboh wohroh meh kǝ bleh la,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">&lt;ma a leh a leke nimeh agohsoh amoh na tutu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">ma a leke mata a tufa andromboh ata mya nza ni bleh mboh ma a lisa reh.&gt;<verse eid="HEB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 3:11" />Meh gu faku na gofo meh kǝ bleh la,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:11">&lt; Ma a nati aniye a na akpo inzi ata meh nati nga mboh tuma fo reh za kpeh!&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 3:12" />ambohroh mboh amboh tufa mboh, lisa nza noh feh! la akyo anyi nimeh amohnoh ta a sohroh a bu na agohsoh ata agugu tasa ata nza ni nati sa nnoh tsifa reh kira nnoh kpeh, ata nza a nati a ha nnoh tufa Nnoh ata nza a bu na fene reh. <verse eid="HEB 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 3:13" />Neh, Nza ni kira la ma a landa akyo ta a hwa nimeh kpakpana kpeh ta a bu na wuwa ikpi kpeh, shingi nnoh itoh amohnoh na tutu, tsifa la, &lt;&lt;Andrehmeh&gt;&gt; amgbasho Nnoh reh atsifa ma ikpi ambohroh. <verse eid="HEB 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 3:14" />Tsifa la mbohroh meh bu anyimbehreh ma Kristi, nza mbohroh meh shi wuwana na andromboh ata mbohroh timi kǝ jiji sa kira reh gu ba ma trina ŋoh reh. <verse eid="HEB 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 3:15" />Ata areh a bu andromboh ata amgbasho reh nza a bleh reh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:15">&lt;&lt;Nza ni sere agba Nnoh reh andrehmeh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:15">kama wuwa nnoh ikpi, tswanza atsiyoh amohnoh mboh tama ka a lisa reh kpeh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:15">tama kpakpana ma Nnoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 3:16" />A bu kyangwri amboh atamaa amboh ata ta maka a sehreh agba Nnoh tama a wuwa ikpi na a ŋoh reh? Ma a bu amboh ata Musa ta ka a fira mboh a kate anyi akpo afiya Masar nambri reh. <verse eid="HEB 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 3:17" />Tana a bu kyangwri amboh atamaa Nnoh ta ka a te gofo na amoh a te ahushi agrumavoh ida aniye reh? <verse eid="HEB 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 3:18" />A bu kyangwri amboh atamaa ata Nnoh ta ka a gu faku ma ikpi amoh la ma a nati aniye ma fo a ŋoh reh kpeh mbimbi? Ma a bu amboh ata nza ma a sehreh tsifa Nnoh kpeh reh. <verse eid="HEB 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 3:19" />Mbohroh meh nza la, mboh reh tama aniye a na inzi ata Nnoh nza nga mboh reh kpeh, tsifa la tama a sa tsifa a ŋoh a kira kpeh.<verse eid="HEB 3:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HEB 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 4:1" />Bu wohroh reh Nnoh nza a bleh reh a gya la handuhwa meh ti hunji atsi tuma fo ŋoh nza ka a leh atsifa ma ikpi reh. lisa nza turoh feh la akyo ambohroh anyi ta a kasa hunji atsi tuma fo wohroh ata nza ma a bleh a gya reh reh kpeh. <verse eid="HEB 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 4:2" />Mbohroh meh sehreh tsifa nana anyi na Nnoh reh tswanza mboh nza ma a sehreh reh. Ma a sehreh tohmoh reh, neh a sohroh a sehnehna kpeh, tsifa la nza ma a sehreh tohmoh reh, ma a sohroh a sa a kira na nga agohsoh amoh anyimbehreh kpeh. <verse eid="HEB 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 4:3" />Mbohroh amboh ata nza meh sa meh ti nga agohsoh reh neh, meh nati hunji niye ma atsi tuma fo ata Nnoh nza a bleh reh a gya reh. A bu tswanza ŋoh nza a bleh la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:3">&lt;&lt;Meh kǝ kputu agohsoh meh kǝ faku bleh gya la:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:3">&lt;Ma a nati a mishi aniye ma atsi ata mya ti kǝ nati nga mboh fo reh kpeh!&gt;&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 4:3">Ŋoh a bleh ata areh neh ŋoh kǝ lisa ndohmoh a ŋoh tre nyi na ameh ŋoh ta ka a lisa inziyo reh. <verse eid="HEB 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 4:4" />Ma akpo anyi nimeh amgbasho Nnoh atsifa ma ikpi ibi ata atehrehkifi na anyi reh: &lt;&lt;Nnoh a tuma afo anyi ma ndohmoh a ŋoh mboh nambri ma ibi ata atehrehkifi na anyi reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HEB 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 4:5" />Ma a gyuru a bleh tsifa ata areh za la: &lt;&lt;Ma a nati aniye ma atsi ata mya ti kǝ nati nga mboh fo reh kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HEB 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 4:6" />Amboh ata ma ta ka a jiji a sehreh tsifa nana reh tama a sohroh a hunji niye ma atsi tuma fo reh kpeh, tsifa la ma a sohroh nga agohsoh amoh kpeh. <verse eid="HEB 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 4:7" />Areh a tsana la Nnoh a gyuru a gya ibi anyi, ka a fi saa la, &lt;&lt;Andrehmeh.&gt;&gt; Ahushi mboh gaga nza ma a gǝga tsifa ma ikpi ŋoh anyi ma aniye Dawuda nimeh amgbasho Nnoh mata ka a jiji ŋa la:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:7">&lt;&lt; Nza ni sehreh noh agba amya andrehmeh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:7">Kama wuwa noh ikpi kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 4:8" />Bu tama a bleh la Yoshuwa nga kyangwri mboh fo ata Nnoh ta ka a bleh mboh a gya reh, Bu Nnoh tama atsifa ma nyina ma ikpi ibi anyi tse kpeh. <verse eid="HEB 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 4:9" />nehnehreh dehreh neh fo reh a treh a yama ma kyangwri Nnoh mboh ika ata Nnoh ta ka afo ma ibi ata atehrehkifi na anyi reh . <verse eid="HEB 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 4:10" />Amboh ata nza ma a sa fo ata Nnoh nza a bleh a gya reh ma a nati a tuma afo anyi ma ndohmoh amoh mboh, tswanza Nnoh ta ka afo anyi ma ndohmoh a ŋoh reh. <verse eid="HEB 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 4:11" />Ba nnoh neh meh ti shi wuwana meh ti hunji niye nimeh fo reh, la akyo ambohroh anyi ta a hwa tswanza ma ta ka a hwa tsifa la ma nga agohsoh amoh kpeh reh.<verse eid="HEB 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 4:12" />Tsifa Nnoh a bu na fene tasa ta a bu na wuwana, ata nza a rya a keh ambya gara na mgba afri ma. A ka a fa akeki a ŋoh mboh nambri a gǝga, a na ma atsi ata fene tasa huru maka a dohsohna, atsi hohroh mboh tasa ariri maka a dohsohna. Tsifa Nnoh ka a nza agohsoh kyangwri nambri tasa kohnoh ata nza a bu nimeh agohsoh amoh mboh reh a wina nambri. <verse eid="HEB 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 4:13" />Andromboh anyi a yama kpeh ata nza meh nati wina huho ŋoh ma Nnoh; awumu mboh reh nambri ata Nnoh nza a lisa reh ma a sohroh a bu huho ma iyo a ŋoh kpeh. Tasa meh nati bleh ŋoh na aniye ambohroh kanga nambri ma ambohroh andromboh ata nza meh kǝ lisa ma tohmoh a ŋoh reh.<verse eid="HEB 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso Bu Firist Agba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 4:14" />Ba turoh, neh, meh ti shi wuwana ma ikpi andromboh ata mbohroh nza meh nga agohsoh mbohroh reh. Meh wina la meh bu na Firist agba ata kǝ na ma tomo Nnoh, Yeso Amehreh Nnoh reh. <verse eid="HEB 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 4:15" />Agba Firist ata mbohroh nza meh bu na wohroh reh a bu ŋoh ka a nza kwini ambohroh a wina, a bu ŋoh ma ta ka a tsara ŋoh a nza ma akeki mboh reh nambri tswanza mbohroh reh, ŋoh neh a sohroh a kpakpana kpeh. <verse eid="HEB 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 4:16" />Nza a bu dehreh ba nnoh meh ti wuwa agohsoh meh ti ba ma inda Nnoh meh ti kama nyiri kpeh. kpra Agohmoh Nnoh. Atsi ata ŋoh ka a nza kwini ambohroh reh, meh nati wina luhu ŋoh ta a shingi reh nza meh kira reh.<verse eid="HEB 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HEB 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 5:1" />Maka a seh Agba firist anyi nimeh kyangwri a ŋoh mboh tasa mata a gu ŋoh a gya ta ka a kwere Nnoh na aniye amoh, ta ka a nga awumu nana agohsoh ma Nnoh tasa ta ka a de ngǝnga ma ikpi kpakpana amoh mboh reh. <verse eid="HEB 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 5:2" />Ŋoh na ikpi a ŋoh reh a bu na nyinana a ŋoh mboh ma akeki mboh gaga za, ma aki wohroh nza a nza kyangwri mboh amboh nza ma kpakpana. A ka a te ve ma amboh ata nza ma a lisa andromboh amboh ata nza ma a zohhoh kpeh. <verse eid="HEB 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 5:3" />Tasa tsifa la ŋoh na ikpi a ŋoh a bu na nyinana a ŋoh, a nati nga awumu nana agohsoh ma Nnoh kanga bu ma ikpi kpakpana kyangwri mboh amoh tsene kpeh neh ma ikpi kpakpana a ŋoh mboh za. <verse eid="HEB 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 5:4" />Akyo ka a mishi a seh ikpi a ŋoh ta a bu Agba Firist kpeh. A ka a bu Nnoh ka a fi la kyangwri ta a bu firist agba tswanza Haruna ta ka a bu Firist reh.<verse eid="HEB 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 5:5" />A bu ma aki wohroh dehreh, Kristi a sohroh a gu ikpi a ŋoh a gya agba la ŋoh ta a bu Firist la ŋoh ta hunji agba kpeh. Neh, Nnoh a bleh ŋoh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:5">&lt;&lt;Nnoh bu Amehreh mya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:5">andrehmeh mya meh kǝ bu Atsiyoh amohnoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 5:6" />A bleh za ma akpo anyi la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:6">&lt;&lt;Ni nati bu firist ata tuma atono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:6">ni mgba Melkizedek ta ka a bu reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 5:7" />Na ameh ata Yeso ta ka a bu ma inziyo tswanza kyangwri reh, a ka kwere Nnoh na tutu. A ka a luhu Nnoh la ta a shingi ŋoh. A ka kwere yivoh ta ka a kpanga na mwueneh a na na ŋoh ata nza a nati a sa ŋoh a hwana nyi ma kwo reh. Nnoh ka a sehreh kwere ata Yeso nza a kwere reh, tsifa la Yeso akuku ikpi a ŋoh tasa za la a ka te ndohmoh a ŋoh na agohsoh anyimbehreh. Nnoh ka a sehreh ŋoh. <verse eid="HEB 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 5:8" />Ŋoh bu Amehreh Nnoh dehreh neh, nimeh wa iya a ŋoh a sohroh a wuwa ikpi ma Nnoh kpeh. <verse eid="HEB 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 5:9" />Nnoh nza ka a lisa ŋoh a treh na su ŋoh ta ka ka a bu chuhu hunji nvara ma kyangwri mboh nambri amboh ata nza ma a nga ŋoh agba. <verse eid="HEB 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 5:10" />Nnoh ka a fi ŋoh la Agba firist, ikata Melkizedek.<verse eid="HEB 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kpi Ashotoh Ma ikpi Gyuru Nyina ma aki gya agohsoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 5:11" />Tsifa mboh ma a yama gaga ata nza meh nati bleh ma ikpi tsifa ata areh, meh a nati te iya bleh noh ŋoh, tsifa la ni kǝ sohroh sehreh wina neh fifi kpeh. <verse eid="HEB 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 5:12" />nehnehreh dehreh bu ni bu noh amboh tsana mboh, neh, ni tre fa nnoh akyo ata nza a nati tsana noh ma ikpi tsifa Nnoh ata jiji ŋoh. ta ni rya nnoh irya ata wuwana a ŋoh, ni tre kira ti wa nnoh amwo behneh. <verse eid="HEB 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 5:13" />Akyo ata nza a wa amwo behneh reh a treh bu amehreh kǝ hehreh bu na wina andromboh kpeh ma ikpi lisa andromboh yehlehleh ha yehlehleh kpeh. <verse eid="HEB 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 5:14" />Irya ata wuwana a ŋoh reh a bu agbugba mboh amoh, ata bu mboh maka yiyina mata a wina te ndohmoh na kohnoh amoh mata a wina nza andromboh ata nza a bu alindeh tasa ata nza a bu agugu.<verse eid="HEB 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HEB 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 6:1" />Nza a bu dehreh, ba turoh meh ti ta tsana ata amboh jiji ma ikpi Kristi reh, meh ti rya tohmoh na tsana amboh ata ma a kira reh, tasa za la meh ti sohroh gya chuhu tsana ma ikpi nga agohsoh ambohroh ma Nnoh kpeh, tasa ata meh ti gyuruna ta ndohmoh ata nza a nati a de reh a na ma kwo reh. <verse eid="HEB 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 6:2" />Tsifa tsana ma ikpi batisma tasa ata gya ivoh te atoh; tasa ata gyuru hinga amboh kwo mboh, tasa ata hwra akpi ata ibi ata trina ŋoh reh. <verse eid="HEB 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 6:3" />Ba nnoh ma rya tohmoh! Areh bu andromboh ata nza meh nati lisa, nza Nnoh a kira.<verse eid="HEB 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 6:4" />Ma a nati lisa lele masa a gyuru a fi amboh ata nza ma a gyuru nyina ma nga agohsoh amoh, mata a gyuru a ba amoh aki yama? Tama a bu nimeh zana Nnoh na lo anyi; ma bara ngǝnga ata inza a nza tasa tama a sa avu Huru zanana amoh za a nza. <verse eid="HEB 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 6:5" />Tama a jiji a wina ma agohsoh amoh la tsifa Nnoh reh a zohhoh, tasa tama bara wuwana ika ata ba ma ma tohmoh reh. <verse eid="HEB 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 6:6" />Maka a gyuru nyina ma aki nga agohsoh amoh! A nati te iya mata a gyuru a wa mboh a ba ma aki tufa yehlehleh yama, tsifa la areh ma a gyuru koro Amehreh Nnoh za tasa ma a nga a ŋoh sa ma hohroh kyangwri mboh.<verse eid="HEB 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 6:7" />Nnoh a te atoh ma avru ata nza ka a wa awi ata nza ka a tamba ma ikpi a ŋoh tasa ata mehreh agbeh mboh nza maka a fana a zohhoh ma amboh nza maka a hafa reh. <verse eid="HEB 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 6:8" />Nza inzi reh neh ka a fana atohtoh tasa bini abibi mboh, wohroh a zohhoh kpeh; a bu nimeh te aniye ata Nnoh, ma a nati a lofo na shira.<verse eid="HEB 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 6:9" />Ha neh nza meh bleh dehreh za, iziza amya mboh ata mya nza kira na amoh, meh wina la ni bu noh na ajija te atoh amboh ata nza ma a bu alindeh ma ikpi tsifa hunji nvara. <verse eid="HEB 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 6:10" />Nnoh reh a bu na kira ikpi kpeh. A nati te kohhroh na ndohmoh ata nza ni lisa noh reh kpeh ha kira ata nza ni tsana noh reh kpeh, ma aki nga shingi ma amboh tufa mboh reh, avoh nehnehreh ni tre lisa nnoh. <verse eid="HEB 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 6:11" />A bu kira Mbohroh la nambri ma amohnoh ti tsana noh johjoh ata nza ni bu noh na wohroh reh a gu a na te trina ŋoh, tsifa la andromboh ata nza ni gya noh agohsoh ma ikpi a ŋoh reh ta a ba ba bu zizi. <verse eid="HEB 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 6:12" />Meh kira la ti bu noh amboh yangru mboh kpeh, neh ti bu noh tswanza amboh nza ma a nga agohsoh tasa maka a bu na soh ivoh yira, ma aki wohroh maka a sa andromboh ata Nnoh nza a bleh a gya reh.<verse eid="HEB 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nnoh A bleh A gya Ata A zizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 6:13" />Na ameh ata Nnoh ta ka a bleh Ibrahim tsifa a gya reh, ka a faku la ŋoh a nati a lisa andromboh ata ŋoh ta ka a bleh a gya reh. Ka a faku reh la ŋoh a nati a lisa andromboh ata ŋoh nza a bleh reh, nza ka a nza la akyo anyi a yama ata nza a keh a ŋoh kpeh a ka a faku na isa a ŋoh. <verse eid="HEB 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 6:14" />A bleh la, &lt;&lt;Zizi meh nati te nnoh atoh tasa meh ti nga nnoh alohsoh gaga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HEB 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 6:15" />Ibrahim tana bu na soh ivoh yira, ka a sa andromboh ata Nnoh ta ka a bleh a gya reh. <verse eid="HEB 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 6:16" />Nza meh faku reh, meh kǝ faku na sa akyo ata nza a keh reh, faku reh a ka shimba keh na aniye mboh reh nambri. <verse eid="HEB 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 6:17" />amboh ata ma ta ka a nati sa andromboh ata ta ka a bleh a gya reh, Nnoh a kira ta a tsana a kate la ŋoh a nati a mishi sene agohsoh a ŋoh kpeh; neh ka a faku a mishi ma ikpi bleh gya a ŋoh reh. <verse eid="HEB 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 6:18" />Andromboh mboh afri ma a yama, ata nza a tsana ma ikpi Nnoh la a nati a wina sene na kpeh tasa Nnoh a nati wina huru tsifa kpeh, mbohroh nza meh gbo ba ba hunji fene na a ŋoh reh nga reh wuwa agohsoh meh ti shi wuwana yivoh de andromboh ata nza meh gya agohsoh ma ikpi ŋoh reh. <verse eid="HEB 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 6:19" />Meh bu na gya agohsoh ata areh a tswanza rishi ata fene ambohroh reh. A bu lafa gya ŋoh tasa a bu gbigbi, a bu ŋoh ka aniye nimeh a na nyina lefe nza ma a kohhroh ma atsi zanana nimeh ida Nnoh reh. <verse eid="HEB 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 6:20" />Atsi ata Yeso, nza a jiji a na aniye ambohroh reh. Ŋoh kǝ bu firist ata inza gu a na ta tuma atono, ika ta Melkizedek reh.<verse eid="HEB 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HEB 7" />
  <para style="s1">Melkizedek A bu Firist Agba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 7:1" />Melkizedek tana bu Agohmoh Salem, tasa za tana a bu firist Nnoh Ata nza a keh Agba. Ibrahim ta ka a buti nyi gofo a ba a ŋoh ata ŋoh ta ka a rya agohgohmoh mboh anneh reh, Melkizedek ka a dohsohna na a ŋoh ta ka a te atoh ma Ibrahim, <verse eid="HEB 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 7:2" />tasa Ibrahim ka nga ŋoh itrenyi ata awumu mboh reh nambri. Ma jiji ŋoh isa Melkizedek reh a tsana la &lt;&lt;Agohmoh lisa Yelele&gt;&gt;; tasa za la ŋoh bu Agohmoh ata Salem, isa a ŋoh a tana afri reh za a tsana la &lt;&lt;Agohmoh tuma alindeh&gt;&gt;. <verse eid="HEB 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 7:3" />Akyo a sohroh a wina alehmeh ha akre kpeh ma a sohroh a wina ha ka bu chu mboh kpeh; akyo a sohroh a wina ibi mara a ŋoh ha ibi kwo a ŋoh kpeh. Ŋoh a tswanza a bu amehreh Nnoh reh ma; A bu firist dehreh a tswa atsi tuma atono. <verse eid="HEB 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 7:4" />Nza nnoh biroh agba Melkizedek reh, Ibrahim ada agba ambohroh ata kiri reh a nga ŋoh itrenyi ata awumu mboh nza a fira nyi ma gofo reh. <verse eid="HEB 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 7:5" />Amgbasho Akpi Musa reh a tsana la, alohsoh Lawiyawa mboh nza ma a bu firist reh mata a sa Trenyi anyi na kyangwri Israila mboh, wohroh reh anyi na kyangwri amoh mboh, mboh reh nza ma a bu alohsoh Ibrahim. <verse eid="HEB 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 7:6" />Melkizedek tana a bu alohsoh Alawi kpeh. ŋoh neh ka a sa itrenyi nyi na Ibrahim ta ka a te ŋoh atoh, Kyangwri reh ata nza a sa andromboh ata Nnoh nza a bleh a gya reh. <verse eid="HEB 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 7:7" />Kpa aniye a yama kpeh la akyo ata nza ka a te atoh bu agba a keh akyo ata nza ma a te ŋoh atoh reh. <verse eid="HEB 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 7:8" />Nza a bu firist amboh ata alohsoh Alawi reh neh, ni wina noh la mboh ma a bu amboh kwo mboh, maka a wina sa itrenyi reh nyi ma ivoh kyangwri mboh; Melkizedek neh ata nza a sa itrenyi nyi ma ivoh akyo ata nza a bu na fene, tswanza amgbasho Nnoh nza a bleh reh. <verse eid="HEB 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 7:9" />Kyangwri mboh maka a hehndeh a bleh la, nza Ibrahim a fanga trenyi reh, Alawi ata nza a bu alohsoh a ŋoh mi nza a bu kyangwri sa itrenyi reh, ka a fanga za. <verse eid="HEB 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 7:10" />Tama a hehreh a mara Alawi na ameh wohroh kpeh, neh tana a treh a bu nimeh itoh Ada a ŋoh Ibrahim na ameh ata Melkizedek ta ka a hunji ŋoh reh.<verse eid="HEB 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 7:11" />Akpi Musa reh a bleh za la Firist mboh reh ma a nati anyi ma alohsoh Alawi, Firist amboh wohroh reh ma a nati a wina lisa akyo ta a su kpeh, a zohhoh meh ti bu na Firist tswanza Melkizedek, na ata mata a hunji firist ata nza anyi ma alohsoh Haruna ata ta ka a bu Firist reh. <verse eid="HEB 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 7:12" />Nza ma a sehneh firist a nati bu kanga mata a sehneh akpi mboh reh za. <verse eid="HEB 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 7:13" />Akyo ata nza ma a leh a bleh tsifa ma ikpi a ŋoh reh a bu Ada ambohroh, ata nza anyi ma alohsoh anyi tse. Akyo anyi ma alohsoh wohroh kǝ hehreh de kpra firist reh nza kpeh. <verse eid="HEB 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 7:14" />Kyangwri mboh nambri tama a wina la, tama a mara ŋoh anyi ma alohsoh Yahuza; Musa a sohroh a bleh la Firist a nati anyi ma alohsoh ata areh kpeh.<verse eid="HEB 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Firist Anyi za A tswanza Melkizedek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 7:15" />Tsifa reh ka a kate fyafya la; firist anyi tse a ba, ata nza a tswanza Melkizedek. <verse eid="HEB 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 7:16" />Tama a gu a gya Firist, bu ma aki tufa kyangwri kpeh, neh ka a bu aki wuwana ata fene ata nza ka a trina kpeh. <verse eid="HEB 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 7:17" />Amgbasho Nnoh a bleh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:17">&lt;&lt;Ni nati tuma Firist gu na ti tuma atono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 7:17">tswanza Melkizedek ta ka a bu reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HEB 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 7:18" />Dehreh neh, gu nnoh atono akeki tufa reh gya nnoh na nda, tsifa la tana a bu na wuwana kpeh tasa tana a zohhoh kpeh. <verse eid="HEB 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 7:19" />Akpi Musa tana lisa andromboh alindeh kpeh. nehnehreh maka nga reh gya agohsoh ata nza a keh zohhoh ma aki ata meh kpusu ba ma inda na Nnoh.<verse eid="HEB 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 7:20" />Mata a bleh mishi, Nnoh tana a gu faku za. Na ameh ata nza ma a gu mgbiri kyangwri mboh a gya firist reh, faku ika wohroh tana a yama kpeh. <verse eid="HEB 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 7:21" />Yeso a bu firist ma aniye faku Nnoh nza a bleh reh la:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">&lt;&lt; Ada tana a gu faku la.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 7:21">a nati a gyuru a sehneh agohsoh a ŋoh kpeh:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">&lt;Ni nati bu firist a gu a na na ti tuma atono.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 7:22" />A bu tsifa faku Nnoh reh ŋa Yeso ka bu ata shi ma atsitsifi bleh gya ata nza a keh zohhoh reh. <verse eid="HEB 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 7:23" />Tsifa anyi tse a yama la; Firist mboh amboh ata kiri ma a bu a gaga tama a kwo, kwo reh ka a ha mboh rya tohmoh na ndohmoh amoh mboh reh. <verse eid="HEB 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 7:24" />Yeso neh ka a nati a leh a tuma atono, ndohmoh a ŋoh a tswanza firist reh ma a nati a za nga akyo za kpeh. <verse eid="HEB 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 7:25" />Nza a bu dehreh a nati a wina sa kyangwri mboh a hwana amboh ata nza ma a ba na Nnoh ma aki a ŋoh reh, tsifa la ŋoh a tuma atono ta a leh a kwere Nnoh tsifa amoh. <verse eid="HEB 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 7:26" />Yeso a bu Firist agba ata inza ata nza a tswa reh ma agohsoh, ata nza a bu na zanana, ata nza a wina andromboh kpeh, ata nza a bu na kpakpana andromboh kpeh, ŋoh a bu tse na mgbiri kyangwri mboh amboh ata nza ma a bu na kpakpana, ŋoh bu agba ma a gu ŋoh a gya a ka a keh amboh nza ma a bu ma ikpi inza agba. <verse eid="HEB 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 7:27" />Ŋoh a sohroh a bu tswanza mgbiri Agbugba Firist mboh reh kpeh, maka a leh a de ngǝnga ata nana agohsoh na tutu ma ikpi kpakpana a ŋoh feh sa ka a lisa ata kpakpana kyangwri mboh amoh. Ka a de ngǝnga ata nana agohsoh reh a ba hwana anyimbehreh nambri, ameh ata ta ka a gu ikpi a ŋoh a fanga reh. <verse eid="HEB 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 7:28" />Akpi Musa reh a ka a seh kyangwri mboh amboh ata nza ma nyinana reh; bleh a gya ata Nnoh reh neh ta ka a faku reh, ata nza a ba nyina tsana amgbasho Musa reh. Ka a seh Amehreh ata nza ma a gu a gya ta a su a tswa atsi tuma atono reh.<verse eid="HEB 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HEB 8" />
  <para style="s1">Yeso A bu Agba Firist Ambohroh,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 8:1" />Andromboh ata mbohroh nza meh leh tsifa ma ikpi reh a bu la, meh bu na Firist agba ika ata areh, ata nza a tuma na mgba ivoh rya a kpa Nnoh ma kpra Agohmoh a ŋoh ma inza. <verse eid="HEB 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 8:2" />A te ndohmoh ma kpra Agohmoh agba ata nza tswanza Firist nimeh ida Nnoh, ameh dasa ata a zizi nza maka a krumusu Nnoh reh tana a bu Ada na ikpi a ŋoh nza a lisa reh, a bu na ivoh kyangwri kpeh.<verse eid="HEB 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 8:3" />Firist agbugbaa mboh reh nambri maka a seh mboh la mata ka a de ngǝnga tasa ngǝnga ata woafiya mboh a ba ma Nnoh, nza a bu dehreh a zohhoh agbugba Firist ambohroh mboh za mata a hunji ngǝnga ata ma a nati a de a na ma Nnoh kanga. <verse eid="HEB 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 8:4" />Bu ma a bleh la a treh a yama ma inziyo reh, ŋoh reh ma a sohroh a mishi a bu Firist kpeh, tsifa la Firist mboh tama a yama ma inziyo amboh ata tama ka a de ngǝnga a na ma Nnoh. Tama ka a lisa dehreh tswanza akpi nza a bleh mboh reh. <verse eid="HEB 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 8:5" />Ndohmoh ata Firist mboh tama ka a leh a te ma akpo zanana reh, tana a leh a tsana biroh ndohmoh ata maka a lisa ma inza reh mi. A bu dehreh tswanza ta ka a bu na Musa reh. Ameh ata ŋoh ta ka a nati a mina ameh dasa ma Nnoh reh, Nnoh tana a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Lisa nza yehlehleh ti mina biroh ika ata tama ka a tsana noh ma ikpi agbohgboh reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HEB 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 8:6" />Nehnehreh neh ma a nga ma Yeso ndohmoh Firist ata nza a keh amoh reh zohhoh, tswanza tsifa ata bleh gyaa reh a keh amoh reh zohhoh, ata nza bu Yeso mi na ikpi a ŋoh nza a bu ma atsitsifi Nnoh tasa kyangwri a ŋoh mboh reh, tsifa ata bleh gyaa reh a zohhoh tsifa la ma a gya ma ikpi tsifa alindeh.<verse eid="HEB 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 8:7" />Bu tama a bleh la kpakpana a yama na tsifa ata bleh gyaa ata jiji reh kpeh, bu mbohroh timi za gyuru fa ata afri reh kpeh. <verse eid="HEB 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 8:8" />Nnoh neh ka a nza hwa kyangwri a ŋoh mboh atsi ŋoh nza a bleh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">Ameh a nati ba, Ada reh a bleh dehreh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:8">ata meh nati gyuru bleh tsifa afeh anyi gya</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">ma kyangwri Israila mboh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:8">tasa kyangwri Yahuda mboh.<verse eid="HEB 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 8:9" />A nati a tswanza tsifa ata meh ti kǝ bleh gya na ada amoh mboh amboh kiri reh kpeh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">ma ibi ata meh ti kǝ de mboh na ivoh amya kate ta akpo afiya Masar reh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">Mboh reh tama nga agohsoh na tsifa ata meh ti kǝ bleh gya na amoh reh kpeh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">mya meh za kohnoh na amoh za kpeh.<verse eid="HEB 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 8:10" />Nehnehreh, ata areh a bu tsifa ata mya meh nati bleh gya na kyangwri Israila mboh reh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">Ameh a nati a ba, Ada reh a bleh dehreh:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">Meh nati gya akpi amya nimeh kohnoh amoh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">tasa za meh nati ŋa mboh nimeh agohsoh amoh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">Meh nati bu Nnoh amoh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">tasa mboh za tama a bu kyangwri amya mboh<verse eid="HEB 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 8:11" />Akyo anyi nimeh amoh a nati a wina tsana ziza a ŋoh mboh kpeh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">ha akyo anyi ta a bleh ma atohngoh amoh mboh la,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">&lt;Wina Ada.&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:11">Nambri ma amoh ma a nati a wina meh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">a nati a gu anyi na ata nza a bu akehreh reh a gu a na na ata nza a keh agba reh.<verse eid="HEB 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 8:12" />Meh nati te kohhroh na kpakpana amoh mboh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:12">tasa za meh nati kohnoh na andromboh abibi amoh mboh reh za kpeh.<verse eid="HEB 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 8:13" />Nnoh nza atsifa dehreh ma ikpi tsifa bleh gya afeh reh, ŋoh a gyuru a de ata jiji reh a te ata atono; tasa za andromboh nza a bu ata kiri nza bu atono reh a nati a hwa a lalana ma.<verse eid="HEB 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HEB 9" />
  <para style="s1">Krumusu Ata Inza Tasa ata Inziyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 9:1" />Tsifa bleh gya ata jiji reh, a bu na biroh krumusu a ŋoh tasa atsi krumusu a ŋoh za. <verse eid="HEB 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 9:2" />Israila mboh reh tama ka la dasa ata nza bu atsi huru, adada afri tana ka a yama nimeh dasa reh, ata nza a bu ma inziyo reh, tama ka a fi la atsi Huru. Ma a huru reh ikpoh kohhroh shira, tasa ateburu, tasa afohfohnoh ata maka a nga ma Nnoh reh. <verse eid="HEB 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 9:3" />Na mgba nyina kuri hama anida ata afri reh, ida anyi a yama ata maka a fi la, atsi ata nza a keh zanana. <verse eid="HEB 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 9:4" />Nimeh a huru reh a gbo atsi ata maka a kwere Nnoh reh a yama, ma a lisa na kpakpa hungroh la mata ka afya awumu angǝshi reh ma ikpi, tasa akwati tsifa ata Nnoh nza a bleh a gya na kyangwri a ŋoh mboh reh a yama za. Ma a lisa akwati reh a goh na kpakpa hungroh ata ahungwri, nimeh akwati reh azo kpakpa hungroh ata ahungwri anyi a yama ata a bu na irya alindeh anyi nimeh ata maka a fi la manna, tasa ikpoh Haruna ata ta ka a fana asho a kate, tasa kpakpa afri ata tama ka a ŋa akpi ma ikpi reh. <verse eid="HEB 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 9:5" />Awumu amgba amboh ata nza ma a bu na fene ma a yama ma ikpi akwati reh, wohroh a tsana la Nnoh reh a bu agba tasa za a yama na amoh, amgba amoh mboh ma a fesena a treh atsi ata ma a nati a te kohhroh na kpakpana amoh mboh reh. Nehnehreh neh, meh nati wina bleh noh tsifa andromboh ti sere wina noh kpeh.<verse eid="HEB 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 9:6" />Nza maka a lisa awumu mboh a treh dehreh. Ka a bu Firist mboh na tutu maka aniye a na na a te ndohmoh <note caller="+" style="fe"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false" /></note>amoh nimeh ida dasa ata anyimbehreh reh, <verse eid="HEB 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 9:7" />nimeh ida dasa ata na afri reh neh ka a bu agba Firist ŋoh tsene ka aniye a na nimeh ida ata afri reh, ka a lisa dehreh hwana anyimbehreh ma ahuhushi. Ka a de imya woaye mboh ata ŋoh nza a mla reh, ka a na na a jiji a nga ma Nnoh imya reh tsifa kpakpana a ŋoh a treh fya, tasa tsifa kpakpana ata kyangwri mboh nza ma a lisa na wina amoh kpeh reh. <verse eid="HEB 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 9:8" />Ma aki wohroh reh, Huru Nnoh ata zanana reh a tsana a kate la ida ata nza a keh zanana reh ma a hehreh a vuru kpeh, nza dasa ata jiji reh a treh a shi. <verse eid="HEB 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 9:9" />Ata areh a tswanza yafa ata nza a tsana ameh ambohroh ata nehnehreh. Ata areh a tsana za la ngǝnga ambohroh ma Nnoh tasa ata sangra imya woaye mboh reh ma a nati a wina de agohsoh amboh krumusu Nnoh mboh reh mata a bu yehlehleh kpeh, <verse eid="HEB 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 9:10" />amboh areh a bu tsifa wa tasa rya tasa akeki hwara itoh amoh mboh ma atsetse, amboh areh ma bu amboh ata inziyo ma, maka a lisa dehreh la Nnoh tana a tsana aki anyi afeh ŋoh fya. <verse eid="HEB 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 9:11" />Kristi neh kǝ ba tswanza Firist agba ŋoh reh. A de awumu alilehndeh a ba reh ata meh bu na wohroh ma mareh. Dasa ata ŋoh nza a te ndohmoh nimeh reh a keh agba tasa za a keh zohhoh, ata a bu kyangwri a mina kpeh, wohroh reh a bu biroh ika ata inziyo areh kpeh. <verse eid="HEB 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 9:12" />Kristi reh aniye a na ida ata nza a keh zanana reh tsifa ambohroh hwana anyimbehreh, a sohroh a gu imya ibi ha londo a ŋoh kpeh, ŋoh neh a gu imya a ŋoh ta a sa reh nvara ata tuma atono. <verse eid="HEB 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 9:13" />Imya bibi mboh tasa londo tasa atoh shira ata ameh londo tama ka a yayasa ma itoh amboh ata nza ma zanana kpeh reh, ata areh tana ka a hwara mboh anyi na arishi amoh mboh reh. <verse eid="HEB 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 9:14" />Nza ata areh a bu zizi reh, ma a nati ka a bleh la umbo? na imya Kristi reh? Ŋoh a sohroh a bu na kpakpana kpeh, a gu ikpi a ŋoh a nga ma Nnoh ma aki huru ata tuma atono, a nati a bu kanga la imya a ŋoh reh ta a hwara kohnoh ma agohsoh ambohroh mboh reh, meh ti ta akeki ndohmoh kiri ata nza a nati a shingi reh kpeh reh la meh ti krumusu Nnoh ambohroh ata nza a bu na fene reh.<verse eid="HEB 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 9:15" />Nza a bu dehreh, a bu ŋoh Kristi a nati a shi ma atsitsifi Nnoh tasa kyangwri mboh nimeh tsifa bleh gya afeh reh, la amboh ata nza ma a fi mboh reh mata a sa gohmoh ata tuma atono ata Nnoh nza a bleh a gya reh. Ata areh a nati a bu dehreh tsifa la akyo anyi kǝ kwo la ŋoh ta a sa kyangwri mboh a hwana anyi na kpakpana ata tama ka a lisa ma hohroh tsifa gya ata jiji reh.<verse eid="HEB 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 9:16" />Nza akyo anyi a ŋa a gya ma ikpi gohmoh a ŋoh, a zohhoh mata a wina kanga la akyo ata nza a ŋa tsifa a bleh a gya reh kǝ kwo fya, <verse eid="HEB 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 9:17" />tsifa bleh gya ma ikpi gohmoh reh a nati a bu na wuwana nza akyo wohroh kǝ a kwo fya, ma a nati a te ndohmoh na wohroh kpeh nza akyo ata nza a bleh a gya reh a treh a bu na fene. <verse eid="HEB 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 9:18" />A bu tsifa wohroh reh la tama a te ndohmoh na tsifa gya ata jiji reh kpeh, nza tama a hunji imya fya. <verse eid="HEB 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 9:19" />Na jiji wohroh reh Musa kǝ hwra akpi ata Nnoh nza a nga ŋoh nambri a bleh ma kyangwri mboh reh. A ka a gu imya mara londo mboh tasa ata bibi mboh tofo na amwo. A treh feh sa ka a gu asohsoh ata asho agbeh anyi nza maka a fi la, izob tasa alulu atishaa, feh sa ka a mimishi imya reh na wohroh ma ikpi amgbasho akpi Nnoh reh tasa ma ikpi kyangwri mboh nambri. <verse eid="HEB 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 9:20" />A ka a bleh mboh la,&lt;&lt;Ata areh a bu imya ata nza a dohsoh reh na tsifa bleh gyaa ata Nnoh ta ka a bleh la mata a tufa reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HEB 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 9:21" />Ma aki wohroh za Musa tana a mimishi imya ma ikpi ameh Dasa reh, tasa ma ikpi awumu amboh ata maka a te ndohmoh na amoh atsi krumusu reh. <verse eid="HEB 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 9:22" />A bu dehreh zizi, Akpi Musa reh a tsana la ma a hwara awumu mboh reh nambri na imya, nza imya ta a sangrana kpeh, ma a nati a wina a te kohhroh na kpakpana mboh kpeh.<verse eid="HEB 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngǝnga Kristi A gu Kpakpana Mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 9:23" />Awumu amboh areh, ma bu yafa a zizi amboh ata nza ma a yama ma inza reh. Awumu amboh a zizi nza ma a yama ma inza reh, ma a keh kira ngǝnga ata nza a keh zohhoh reh. <verse eid="HEB 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 9:24" />Kristi reh a sohroh aniye a na atsi ata nza a bu na zanana ata nza ma a lisa na ivoh kyangwri reh kpeh, ata ta ka bu yafa ata a zizi reh. Tana aniye a na nimeh a zizi inza, atsi ata ŋoh nza a tsana ikpi a ŋoh ma tohmoh Nnoh tsifa ambohroh reh. <verse eid="HEB 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 9:25" />A sohroh aniye a na ma inza la ŋoh ta ka a leh a de ikpi a ŋoh a na na tutu kpeh, tswanza agba Firist Yahudawa mboh nza ka aniye a na atsi ata nza a keh zanana ma ahuhushi na imya wo mboh, <verse eid="HEB 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 9:26" />nza a bu dehreh, ŋoh Yeso reh a nati a wa iya hwana vara, a gu anyi ameh ata tama ka a lisa inziyo reh. Nehnehreh neh, ŋoh kǝ gu ikpi a ŋoh a kate hwana anyimbehreh ameh ata inziyo wa a nati a trina reh, la ŋoh ta a fufa kpakpana mboh reh ma atsi gu ikpi a ŋoh a fanga. <verse eid="HEB 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 9:27" />Kyangwri mboh reh nambri ma a nati a kwo ma hwana anyimbehreh, a treh feh Nnoh sa ka ahwra mboh akpi. <verse eid="HEB 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 9:28" />Ma aki wohroh za dehreh, tama a gu Kristi reh a fanga hwana anyimbehreh la ŋoh ta a gu kpakpana vara kyangwri mboh reh. A nati a gyuru a ba na afri, a nati a ba tsifa la ŋoh ta za a fanga ikpi a ŋoh tsifa amboh kpakpana mboh za kpeh, a nati a ba neh la ŋoh ta a sa amboh ata nza ma a leh a bana ŋoh reh a hwana.<verse eid="HEB 9:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HEB 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 10:1" />Akpi Musa reh a tswanza lulu awumu alilehndeh amboh ata nza ma a bu ma tohmoh reh, lulu reh a sohroh a bu awumu alilehndeh mboh reh kpeh, la a nati a sohroh a nga kyangwri mboh nvara anyina kpakpana amoh mboh reh kpeh, ma ikpi ngǝnga amoh ata ahuhushi reh. <verse eid="HEB 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 10:2" />Bu tama a bleh la ma a hwara kpakpana kyangwri amboh tufa Nnoh mboh reh, bu mboh reh tama bu na kpakpana za kpeh, tasa za bu ngǝnga mboh reh ma a shi. <verse eid="HEB 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 10:3" />Ngǝnga mboh reh neh, tama ka a lisa dehreh la ta ka a kohnoh mboh na kpakpana amoh mboh ma ahuhushi reh. <verse eid="HEB 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 10:4" />Tsifa la mya londo mboh tasa ata bibi mboh a nati a wina hwara kpakpana ambohroh mboh kpeh.<verse eid="HEB 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 10:5" />A bu ma ikpi tsifa wohroh reh, ameh ata Kristi ta ka a nati a ba inziyo reh, ka a bleh ma Nnoh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:5">&lt;&lt;Nnoh ni kira na ngǝnga tasa ngǝnga ata wusu reh kpeh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:5">nnoh neh ni lisa meh itoh anzoh.<verse eid="HEB 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 10:6" />Nnoh ni sohroh nza na na na iwoaye amboh ata nza maka a yaha mboh ma agboh atsi yaha reh kpeh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:6">ha na ngǝnga ata nana agohsoh ata hwara kpakpana mboh.<verse eid="HEB 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 10:7" />Mya reh meh kǝ bleh la, &lt;Nza mya uwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">Nnoh, meh ba la meh ti lisa andromboh nza ni kira reh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">tswanza nza ma a ŋa a gya ma ikpi amya nimeh amgbasho akpi Musa reh&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 10:8" />A ka a jiji a bleh la,&lt;&lt;Ni sohroh kira ha ti nza na na na ngǝnga, tasa ngǝnga ata wusu, tasa ngǝnga ata maka afya wo ma a gbo atsi ata maka a yaha reh, tasa ngǝnga ata hwara kpakpana mboh reh. A bleh dehreh neh ŋoh za a wina la akpi Musa a bleh la mata a lisa dehreh. <verse eid="HEB 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 10:9" />A ka a gyuru a bleh za la, &lt;&lt; Nnoh, nza mya uwe, meh ba la meh ti lisa andromboh ata ni kira reh.&gt;&gt; Nnoh neh kǝ gu biroh ngǝnga ata atono hinga, neh ta ka a gu ngǝnga ata Kristi reh a gya ma a huru. <verse eid="HEB 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 10:10" />Tsifa la Yeso Kristi reh tana a lisa andromboh ata Nnoh nza a kira ŋoh ta a lisa reh. Ma a hwara reh anyi na kpakpana ambohroh mboh, atsi ata ŋoh nza a gu itoh a ŋoh a fanga tsifa ambohroh hwana anyimbehreh ma reh. <verse eid="HEB 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 10:11" />Firist Yahudawa mboh reh nambri tama ka a te ndohmoh amoh na tutu, tama ka a de ngǝnga ata nana agohsoh ata nza a nati a wina hwara kpakpana mboh kpeh reh a ba. <verse eid="HEB 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 10:12" />Kristi reh neh, a de ngǝnga anyimbehreh ata nana agohsoh ata tuma atono reh la ta a hwara kpakpana ambohroh mboh, ŋoh reh a tuma na mgba ivoh rya a kpa Nnoh. <verse eid="HEB 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 10:13" />Nza ka anyi ameh wohroh reh, a treh a leh a bana la Nnoh ta a gu akyo ata nza a fi ŋoh ma tohmoh reh a te kpra a gya hwana a ŋoh ma hohroh hwana a ŋoh. <verse eid="HEB 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 10:14" />A bu tsifa la ŋoh nza a gu ikpi a ŋoh a fanga hwana anyimbehreh reh, Kristi a lisa amboh ata nza ma a hwara mboh anyi ma kpakpana amoh mboh reh, la mata a bu yehlehleh ata tuma atono.<verse eid="HEB 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 10:15" />Huru Nnoh reh za a bleh reh ma ikpi Kristi reh za la, ata areh a bu zizi. A ka a jiji a bleh la:<verse eid="HEB 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 10:16" />&lt;&lt;Ata areh a bu tsifa ata mya nza ni nati bleh gya na amoh reh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">nimeh ibi amboh ata nza ma a nati a ba reh, Ada reh a bleh dehreh la:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:16">Meh nati gya akpi amya nimeh agohsoh amoh mboh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">tasa za meh ti ŋa mboh nimeh ahroh amoh mboh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 10:17" />A ka a gyuru a bleh za la, &lt;&lt;Meh nati za kohnoh na kpakpana amoh mboh tasa ndohmoh agugu amoh mboh za kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 10:18" />Nza Nnoh a te kohhroh na kpakpana mboh reh, ngǝnga anyi a sohroh a yama ata nza a nati a hwara kpakpana mboh reh kpeh.<verse eid="HEB 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kpusu Ba Turoh Ma Inda Nnoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 10:19" />Nza a bu dehreh, ambohroh mboh amboh tufa mboh, Mbohroh meh nati wina niye na atsi ata nza a bu na zanana a keh reh, ma ikpi kwo Yeso reh. <verse eid="HEB 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 10:20" />A vuru reh aki afeh anyi, aki reh a bu na fene, ata nza a bu ma aki hwashi kuri anida reh, aki wohroh reh a bu itoh a ŋoh.<verse eid="HEB 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 10:21" />Meh bu na agba Firist ata nza a de kyangwri Nnoh mboh. <verse eid="HEB 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 10:22" />Nza a bu dehreh ba turoh timi ba ma inda Nnoh reh na agohsoh ambohroh ata a zizi reh tasa nga agohsoh, tasa agohsoh ambohroh mboh ata nza ma a hwara anyi na vari kpakpana reh tasa ma a hwara itoh ambohroh mboh za na amwo zanana. <verse eid="HEB 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 10:23" />Ba turoh meh shi wuwana ma ikpi gya agohsoh ata mbohroh nza meh bu na wohroh reh, meh wina la meh nati kira na Nnoh ta a lisa reh awumu amboh ata nza a bleh a gya reh. <verse eid="HEB 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 10:24" />Ba turoh timi nza itoh ambohroh wina, meh ti shingi itoh ambohroh tasa za timi kira na itoh ambohroh atsi lisa alindeh. <verse eid="HEB 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 10:25" />Mbohroh meh nati sohroh ta dohsohna ambohroh ma akpo anyimbehreh reh kpeh, tswanza mgbiri maka a lisa reh, mbohroh neh meh ti lisa leh nga wuwa agohsoh ma itoh ambohroh, tswanza mohnoh nza ni nza noh la iba Nnoh kǝ ba whiri reh.<verse eid="HEB 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 10:26" />Nehnehreh ngǝnga anyi ata nana agohsoh a sohroh a yama ata ma a nati a de ba ta a hwara kpakpana mboh za kpeh, nza mbohroh meh leh rya tohmoh na kpakpana mboh reh na wina ambohroh neh ma a bleh reh tsifa a zizi reh, ngǝnga ata hwara kpakpana anyi a za a yama kpeh. <verse eid="HEB 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 10:27" />Neh andromboh ata nza a treh a hwa reh, ti bana nnoh nimeh nyiri tsifa ata hwra akpi a ŋoh nza a nati a ba reh tasa shira ata nza a yaha veve kpeh a nati a ba ta a lofo amboh ata nza ma a fi Nnoh ma tohmoh reh! <verse eid="HEB 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 10:28" />Akyo ata nza a leke ta a tufa akpi reh ma a nati a mla ŋoh a shebiri, kwini a nati a yama kpeh, nza kyangwri afri ha atatoh mata a nza a bleh reh. <verse eid="HEB 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 10:29" />Umbo a nati a hunji amboh ata nza ma a rina Amehreh Nnoh reh amboh ata nza ma a gu imya Nnoh ata bleh gya reh a fi ava, ata nza a hwara mboh anyi ma kpakpana amoh mboh reh, amboh ata nza ma a kya huru ata lisa alindeh reh Kohnoh biroh iya abibi ata nza a nati a zohhoh mata a nga mboh reh! <verse eid="HEB 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 10:30" />Mbohroh meh wina akyo ata nza a bleh la,&lt;&lt;Meh nati sa aniye, Meh nati gyuru fanga&gt;&gt;; tasa akyo ata nza a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Ada a nati ahwra akpi ma kyangwri a ŋoh mboh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HEB 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 10:31" />A bu andromboh nga nyiri, kyangwri ta a hwa ma ivoh Nnoh ata nza a bu na fene reh.<verse eid="HEB 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 10:32" />Kohnoh nnoh na andromboh ata ta ka a hunji noh na ahushi amboh gǝga mboh reh. Ameh ata zana Nnoh ta ka a hunji noh reh, tini wa nnoh iya ma ikpi awumu mboh reh gaga, mohnoh neh ni de noh ikpi ahroh nimeh iya mboh reh, iya mboh a sohroh a keh wuwana amohnoh kpeh. <verse eid="HEB 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 10:33" />Tana ka a mehheh neh kyangwri mboh tama ka a kya nnoh kakende, tasa za tama ka nga noh iya ma tohmoh kyangwri mboh, tasa tana ka a mehheh za tini kǝ kira nnoh la ti tufa nnoh amboh ata nza ma a leh a wa iya ika wohroh reh. <verse eid="HEB 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 10:34" />Tini wa iya mboh ma amboh ata nza ma a bu ma ida ika reh, tasa tini ta nnoh awumu amohnoh ma a sa a hwa na na johjoh, tsifa la ni wina noh la ni bu noh na gohmoh alindeh ata nza a nati a tuma atono. <verse eid="HEB 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 10:35" />Nza a bu dehreh, kama ta nnoh ivoh na wuwa agohsoh amohnoh reh kpeh, tsifa la a nati a de firoh agba a ba nnoh. <verse eid="HEB 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 10:36" />A zohhoh ti sono ivoh ma yira, la ti lisa andromboh ata Nnoh nza a kira reh ti sa nnoh andromboh ata ŋoh nza a bleh a gya la wa a nati a nga noh reh. <verse eid="HEB 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 10:37" />Tswanza amgbasho Nnoh nza a bleh reh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:37">&lt;&lt;A nati a yanda kpeh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:37">ata nza a nati a ba reh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:37">a nati a ba, a nati a yanda kpeh.<verse eid="HEB 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 10:38" />Kyangwri amya amboh tufa yehlehleh mboh reh, ma a nati a sa tsifa reh a kira mata a bu na fene;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:38">nza akyo anyi nimeh amoh neh a gyuru nyina,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:38">agohsoh amya a nati a nza nana amoh kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 10:39" />Mbohroh neh meh sohroh twanza kyangwri amboh ata maka a gbo a te nyina mata a bleh reh kpeh, mbohroh feh meh bu amboh nga agohsoh ambohroh la fene ambohroh ta a hunji nvara.<verse eid="HEB 10:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HEB 11" />
  <para style="s">Nga Agohsoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 11:1" />Nga agohsoh a bu kira ata a zizi ma ikpi andromboh ata nza meh gya agohsoh, ma ikpi andromboh ata nza maka a sohroh a nza kpeh. <verse eid="HEB 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 11:2" />A bu ma ikpi nga agohsoh amoh ŋa agbugba kyangwri amboh kiri ma ta ka a hunji riri anyi na Nnoh reh. <verse eid="HEB 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 11:3" />A bu ma ikpi nga agohsoh ŋa mbohroh nza meh wina la tama a lisa inziyo na lomo tsifa Nnoh, la mata a lisa andromboh ata iyo ka a nza anyi ma andromboh ata iyo ka a sohroh a nza kpeh. <verse eid="HEB 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 11:4" />A bu nga agohsoh ŋa Habila ta ka a nga awumu ngǝnga ma Nnoh a keh atsini Kayinu reh. Ma ikpi nga agohsoh a ŋoh ka a hunji kira Nnoh la ŋoh a bu kyangwri tufa yehlehleh, la Nnoh na ikpi a ŋoh a sa ngǝnga a ŋoh reh. Ma ikpi nga agohsoh a ŋoh Habila a treh atsifa, nehnehreh ŋoh nza kǝ kwo reh. <verse eid="HEB 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 11:5" />A bu nga agohsoh reh ŋa nza a shwa Enok ta a sohroh a kwo kpeh reh. Neh maka a gu ŋoh a ka a na na Nnoh, akyo ka a sohroh a nza ŋoh kpeh, la Nnoh kǝ gu ŋoh na a ŋoh inza. Amgbasho Nnoh reh a bleh la Nnoh a nza nana a ŋoh feh masa a gu ŋoh a ka ma inza. <verse eid="HEB 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 11:6" />Kyangwri ata nza a bu na nga agohsoh kpeh, a nati a wina nga kuku agohsoh ma Nnoh kpeh, akyo ata nza a nati a ba na Nnoh a nati a jiji a nga agohsoh la Nnoh a yama tasa a ka fanga ma amboh ata nza ma a fa ŋoh reh. <verse eid="HEB 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 11:7" />A bu nga agohsoh ŋa Anuhu nza a sehreh kpi ashotoh Nnoh ma ikpi andromboh ata nza a nati a ba ma tohmoh ata ŋoh nza a sohroh a nza kpeh reh. A tufa tsifa Nnoh ka a lisa gbogblondo amwo maka anvara mboh ma mara a ŋoh mboh. Neh maka a lofo inziyo, Anuhu ka a hunji kira anyi na Nnoh ma ikpi tufa yehlehleh ata nza anyi nimeh nga agohsoh. <verse eid="HEB 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 11:8" />A bu nga agohsoh ŋa Ibrahim nza a tufa tsifa Nnoh ta ka a fi ŋoh la ta a kate a na mgba atsifi ata Nnoh nza a bleh a gya la ŋoh a nati a nga ŋoh reh. A yi kpra Agohmoh a ŋoh reh ata a sohroh a wina atsi ata ŋoh nza a buti na reh kpeh. <verse eid="HEB 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 11:9" />A bu nga agohsoh ŋa ka a tuma tswanza sene ma kpra Agohmoh ata Nnoh nza a bleh a gya la ŋoh a nati a nga ŋoh reh. A tuma ma dasa, tswanza Ishaku tasa Yakubu, ata Nnoh ta ka a bleh a gya ma ikpi amoh reh za. <verse eid="HEB 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 11:10" />Ibrahim tana a buti bana akpo afya agba ata Nnoh ta ka a tsara ta a mina reh, chuhu dida ata mina mboh reh, a bu ata tuma atono. <verse eid="HEB 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 11:11" />A bu na nga agohsoh ŋa Ibrahim ta ka a hunji mara reh, ŋoh neh kǝ te achoh afiya a ŋoh za a hunji mara kpeh. A gya agohsoh a ŋoh na Nnoh la bleh gya a ŋoh reh ta a su. <verse eid="HEB 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 11:12" />Ibrahim reh tana ata achoh gaga, a hwa shidi ma ta kwo. Nza ka anyi na kyangwri anyimbehreh wohroh reh neh, alohsoh a ŋoh ka bu gaga tswanza akpukpa mboh nza ma a yama ma inza reh, a bu gaga tswanza yohroh asehngeh ma akachi fini ata maka a sohroh a wina bleh kpeh reh. <verse eid="HEB 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 11:13" />A bu nimeh nga agohsoh ŋa kyangwri amboh wohroh nza ma a kwo reh. Ma a sohroh a sa andromboh ata Nnoh nza a bleh a gya reh kpeh, neh ma a nza anyi gbugba maka a sa mboh, tasa maka kira la mboh ma a bu sene mboh ma inziyo. <verse eid="HEB 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 11:14" />Amboh ata nza ma a bleh ika wohroh reh ma a tsana la ma a fa akpo afiya ata ikpi amoh. <verse eid="HEB 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 11:15" />Ma a sohroh a leh a kohnoh ma ikpi akpo afiya ta nza ma ata reh kpeh, ma a bleh la ma a lisa dehreh, bu ma a hunji aki mata a gyuruna a na amoh. <verse eid="HEB 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 11:16" />Neh, tama a fa kpra Agohmoh alindeh ŋoh, kpra Agohmoh ata inza. Ka a bu dehreh Nnoh ka a sohroh a kwo isa la ma a fi ŋoh la Nnoh amoh kpeh, la ŋoh kǝ lisa mboh akpo afya ma inza. <verse eid="HEB 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 11:17" />A bu nga agohsoh ŋa Ibrahim a de amehreh a ŋoh Ishaku a nga Nnoh ta ka a tsara ŋoh a nza reh. Tana a bu Ibrahim ŋa, Nnoh ta ka a bleh ŋoh a gya reh, neh a kira la ŋoh ta a gu amehreh a ŋoh anyimbehreh ngǝnga ata nana agohsoh ma Nnoh. <verse eid="HEB 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 11:18" />Nnoh tana a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;A nati anyi na Ishaku ŋa ni nati hunji alohsoh ata mya nza ni bleh gya reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HEB 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 11:19" />Ibrahim a kohnoh la Nnoh a nati a wina a yiri Ishaku anyi ma kwo tasa, nimeh lomo, Ibrahim ka a gyuru a sa Ishaku anyi ma kwo yama. <verse eid="HEB 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 11:20" />A bu nga agohsoh ŋa Ishaku ta ka a bleh te atoh a gya ma tohmoh ma Yakubu tasa Isuwa reh. <verse eid="HEB 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 11:21" />A bu nga agohsoh ŋa Yakubu ta ka a te atoh ma mara Yusufu mboh reh anyinyimbehreh feh sa a ka a kwo reh. A hahana na ikpoh hende a ŋoh ta ka krumusu Nnoh. <verse eid="HEB 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 11:22" />A bu nga agohsoh ŋa Yusufu, nza ta ka a nati a kwo, atsifa la ibi anyi Israila mboh ma a nati a kate anyi ma afya Masar, ka a bleh mboh andromboh ata nza ma a nati a lisa na akofo a ŋoh.<verse eid="HEB 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 11:23" />A bu nga agohsoh ŋa alehmeh Musa mboh ma akre maka a huho ŋoh a te anara atatoh na ameh ata ma ta ka a mara ŋoh reh. Tama a nza la a bu amehreh alindeh, tasa maka a sohroh a nyiri mata a leke tufa tsifa Agohmoh reh kpeh. <verse eid="HEB 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 11:24" />A bu nga agohsoh ŋa Musa, ta ka a te agba, ka a leke la mata a kama a fi ŋoh la amehreh anyifa Agohmoh kpeh reh. <verse eid="HEB 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 11:25" />A kira la ŋoh ta a wa iya na kyangwri Nnoh mboh la ŋoh ta a nza nana kpakpana ata ameh shidi. <verse eid="HEB 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 11:26" />A kohnoh la ŋoh ta a wa iya ma ikpi Kristi a keh hunji asabara ata Masar nambri, a fi iyo a ŋoh ma ikpi fanga ata nza a treh a ba ma tohmoh. <verse eid="HEB 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 11:27" />A bu nga agohsoh ŋa Musa ta ka a yi Masar ata ta a sohroh a nyiri gofo Agohmoh kpeh reh. Tana a de ikpi ahroh tsifa la a leh a nza akyo ata iyo ka a nza kpeh reh. <verse eid="HEB 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 11:28" />A bu nga agohsoh ŋa nza a lisa kira gǝga handa tasa ata bleh mboh la mata awo imya ma anida mboh reh, la Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh ata kwo ta kama a gǝga a mla jiji mara ata amehreh atsifa ata Israila mboh reh kpeh. <verse eid="HEB 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 11:29" />A bu nga agohsoh ŋa Israilawa mboh nza ma a wina te hwana fini akre atisha tswanza a bu ma inzi ata hwara reh; Masarawa mboh za ma a ba ba a lisa neh amwo reh ka a lofo mboh nambri. <verse eid="HEB 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 11:30" />A bu tsifa nga agohsoh ŋa mina kpafa ata Yariko ta ka a hwa na ameh ata Israilawa mboh ma ta ka a hehndeh a goh a te ibi atehrehkifi na nyi reh. <verse eid="HEB 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 11:31" />A bu nga agohsoh ŋa ta ka a shwa angra Rahab anyi ma kwo mboh ma amboh ata nza ma a sohroh a tufa tsifa Nnoh kpeh reh, la ŋoh tana a sa amboh nere atsifi ma ta ka anyi Israila reh. <verse eid="HEB 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 11:32" />Meh ti gyuru tsifa la umbo za? Meh sohroh bu na aki meh ti tsifa ma ikpi Gideyon tasa Barak tasa Samson tasa Jefta tasa Dawuda tasa Samaila tasa amboh sa tsifa Nnoh a bleh mboh reh za kpeh. <verse eid="HEB 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 11:33" />A bu nga agohsoh ŋa ma ta ka a na gofo mata lofo akpokpo atsifi reh. Tama a lisa yehlehleh maka a hunji andromboh ata Nnoh ta ka a bleh a gya reh. Ma a hama aniye Gehgreh mboh, <verse eid="HEB 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 11:34" />mata a mlenze shira agba ata nza a ka a kwo kpeh, ma anvara mla kwo na ambya gara. Tama a za a wuwana kpeh neh, maka a gyuru a wuwana; tama a wuwana ma gofo maka lofo amboh mlana achifi mboh reh. <verse eid="HEB 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 11:35" />A bu nga agohsoh ŋa ifiya mboh tama a hwana kunu alohsoh amoh a gyuru a hinga anyi ma kwo reh. amboh tswa ma a leke la mata a kama ata mboh avoh kpeh la mata a kwo nimeh iya la mata a gyuru a hinga na fene ata nza a keh ata areh. <verse eid="HEB 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 11:36" />Tama a mla amboh anyi tasa maka a te mboh nyi, tasa maka a tsitsiya amboh tswa maka a de mboh a na ma ida ka. <verse eid="HEB 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 11:37" />Tama a dadafa mboh na kpakpa, maka a fa mboh a te afri, tama a mla mboh a kwo na ambya gara. Tama a hehndeh a treh atsifi na ikru ibi ha atashi nza a bu iya ma reh, tama a nga mboh iya abibi. <verse eid="HEB 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 11:38" />inziyo tana a zohhoh mboh kpeh! maka a hehndeh a treh atsifi tswanza amboh gbo gofo ma mgba atsifi ata hwara tasa amba mboh, maka a hehndeh a leh ma hohndoh mboh ma inzi tasa ma hro kpakpa mboh. <verse eid="HEB 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 11:39" />Tama a nza kyangwri mboh reh alindeh ma ikpi nga agohsoh amoh! neh ma a sohroh a sa andromboh ata Nnoh nza a bleh a gya reh kpeh, <verse eid="HEB 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="HEB 11:40" />tsifa la Nnoh a bu na kohnoh alindeh ma ikpi ambohroh. Kohnoh a ŋoh reh a bu la andromboh ata Nnoh nza a kira reh a bu la mata a bu yehlehleh.<verse eid="HEB 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HEB 12" />
  <para style="s">Ada Ambohroh A bu Nnoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 12:1" />Mbohroh meh bu na duma amboh shi a bleh ma ikpi ambohroh reh ma a goh reh. Nza a bu dehreh, ba turoh meh ti fufa andromboh ata nza a nati a ha reh nambri, tasa kpakpana ata nza a bu nimeh ambohroh gaga, tasa meh ti gbo rifa ata nza a bu ma tohmoh ambohroh reh na gya agohsoh. <verse eid="HEB 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 12:2" />Ba nnoh meh ti kya iyo ambohroh na Yeso, ata nga agohsoh ambohroh nza a bu na a ŋoh anyi jiji ŋoh a na na a te ma trina ŋoh reh. A sohroh a gu agohsoh a ŋoh a kate tsifa gbohrohgboh reh kpeh! Neh, tsifa nana ata nza a shi a bana ŋoh reh, a sohroh a kohnoh andromboh ma ikpi te na isa ata kwo ma gbohrohgboh reh kpeh, nehnehreh kǝ tuma na mgba ivoh rya a kpa ata kpra Agohmoh Nnoh.<verse eid="HEB 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 12:3" />Kohnoh nnoh ma ikpi iya ata nza a wa reh; nza a soh ivoh yira na leke ata amboh kpakpana mboh ma ta ka a leke ŋoh reh! nza a bu dehreh, mohnoh za kama kira nnoh agohsoh amohnoh ta a kate kpeh. <verse eid="HEB 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 12:4" />Nimeh kakachana amohnoh ma ikpi kpakpana reh, dehreh neh ni sohroh mlana nnoh tswanza ni nati kwo nnoh kpeh. <verse eid="HEB 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 12:5" />Ni gu nnoh tsifa nga wuwana ata Nnoh ta ka atsifa na amohnoh tswanza mara a ŋoh mboh reh te nnoh kohhroh?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:5">&lt;&lt;Amehreh amya, kama gu fi ava kpeh, nza ada akpi nnoh ashotoh reh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:5">tasa ti kama gu agohsoh amohnoh kate nnoh nza a hwa nnoh kpeh.<verse eid="HEB 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 12:6" />La Ada ka akpi ashotoh ma akyo ata ŋoh nza a kira na a ŋoh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:6">tasa ka a mla akyo ata ŋoh nza a sa ŋoh la a bu amehreh a ŋoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 12:7" />De nnoh ikpi ahroh ma ikpi nza iya ata nza a bu ada a nga noh reh; iya amohnoh reh a tsana la a bu Nnoh a lisa nnoh tswanza mara a ŋoh mboh reh. Amehreh anyi tana a yama ata alehmeh nza a sohroh a mla ŋoh kpeh? <verse eid="HEB 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 12:8" />Nza a sohroh nga nnoh iya ika ata mgbiri mara a ŋoh mboh, a nati a tsana la ni sohroh bu noh a zizi mara a ŋoh mboh kpeh, neh ni bu noh mara a ŋoh mboh. <verse eid="HEB 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 12:9" />Ma ikpi ada ambohroh amboh ata inziyo reh, maka a mla reh, meh kǝ nga mboh agba. Neh meh nati keh tufa kpi ashotoh ada ambohroh ata huru reh meh ti nvara! <verse eid="HEB 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 12:10" />Ada ambohroh amboh inziyo maka nga reh iya shidi ma nza a tswa mboh yehlehleh; Nnoh neh ka a lisa la ta a zohhoh reh, la mbohroh meh ti nza huru zanana a ŋoh. <verse eid="HEB 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 12:11" />Nza ma a nga reh iya, a ka a kputu reh agohsoh na ameh wohroh, a sohroh a bu nana kpeh. Ma tohmoh neh, amboh ata nza ma a nza iya ika wohroh maka a hunji fanga ata tuma alindeh ata tufa yehlehleh.<verse eid="HEB 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kpi Ashotoh Tasa Gohroh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 12:12" />Tsitsi ivoh amohnoh amboh ata ma reh kohoh tasa za ti wuwa nnoh a gboro amohnoh amboh ata nza ma a wuwana kpeh reh! <verse eid="HEB 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 12:13" />Leh hende noh ma aki ata nza a bu wehlehleh, neh ti hunji noh wuwana.<verse eid="HEB 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kpi Ashotoh Ma Ikpi Gyuruna Ta Nnoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 12:14" />Fa noh akeki tuma alindeh na kyangwri mboh, tasa za ti bu noh na zanana, kavoh kpeh reh neh akyo a nati a nza Ada kpeh. <verse eid="HEB 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 12:15" />Lisa nza noh feh ma ikpi gyuruna nyi ma lisa alindeh ata Nnoh reh. Akyo ta kama a bu tswanza ariri agbeh ata nza a te gbiriri reh kpeh, ata ka a te agba ta a de mgbiri mboh reh a chakafa na toso a ŋoh reh. <verse eid="HEB 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 12:16" />Akyo ta a kama a lisa abibi tswanza Isuwa, ata nza a gu agba a ŋoh ata jiji mara a rifa ma tsifa irya anyimbehreh reh kpeh. <verse eid="HEB 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 12:17" />A treh neh, ni wina noh a kira la ŋoh ta a sa te atoh anyi na alehmeh; neh alehmeh ka a leke ta a te ŋoh atoh, la a sohroh a hunji aki ta a gyuru andromboh ata ŋoh nza a lisa reh kpeh, a fa kavoh na mwueneh.<verse eid="HEB 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 12:18" />Ni sohroh ba nnoh agbohgboh Sinai agba ata nza maka a bara reh kpeh, ata nza a bu na shira, shini tasa hungwa agba, tasa ryanza awi, rina tasa inyo agba, ika ata Israilawa mboh, <verse eid="HEB 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 12:19" />ha wri drumu, tasa sehreh agba. Kyangwri mboh nza maka a sehreh agba reh, maka a kwere la mata a kama a za a sehreh tsifa anyi za kpeh, <verse eid="HEB 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 12:20" />la ma a sohroh a wina de ikpi ahroh ma ikpi tsifa nza ma a bleh reh la, &lt;&lt; Nza uwo aye kembese a bara amba reh, ma a nati a dadafa na kpakpa ta a kwo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HEB 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 12:21" />Andromboh ata nza ma a nza reh tana a nga nyiri, Musa ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt; Meh nyiri tasa itoh amya a kya!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 12:22" />Neh, ni ba nnoh Agbohgboh Nnoh tasa akpo afya agba Nnoh ata nza a bu na fene, Wurushalima ata Inza, tasa mara tohmoh Nnoh mboh gaga. <verse eid="HEB 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 12:23" />Ni ba nnoh atsi dohsohna ata mara Nnoh amboh jiji ŋoh, amboh ata nza ma a ŋa isa amoh ma Inza. Ni ba nnoh na Nnoh, ata nza a bu kyangwri hwra akpi ma kyangwri mboh nambri, ta a de huru kyangwri mboh a te yehlehleh. <verse eid="HEB 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 12:24" />Ni ba nnoh na Yeso, ata nza a lisa bleh gya afeh reh, tasa ta a sangra imya ata nza a bleh awumu alilehndeh a keh imya Habila a gya gaga.<verse eid="HEB 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 12:25" />Lisa nza noh, tasa kama leke ti sere nnoh ata nza atsifa reh kpeh. amboh ata nza ma a leke mata a sehreh ata nza a bleh tsifa Nnoh ma Inziyo ma a sohroh anvara kpeh. Mbohroh meh nati lisa lele meh ti nvara nza meh leke ata nza atsifa anyi Inza reh! <verse eid="HEB 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 12:26" />Na ameh wohroh reh agba Nnoh reh a nati a zuzu inziyo reh, nehnehreh neh kǝ bleh gya la, &lt;&lt;Meh nati sohroh zuzu inziyo tsene kpeh, a nati a bu tasa inza za.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HEB 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 12:27" />Tsifa mboh reh &lt;&lt;Hwana anyimbehreh&gt;&gt; a tsana la ma a nati a fufa andromboh ata nza ma a zuzu reh, wohroh reh a bu fufa awumu amboh ata nza ma a lisa reh, tsifa awumu amboh ata ma a nati a zuzu za kpeh, ma a nati a tuma a kasa.<verse eid="HEB 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 12:28" />Nza a bu dehreh, ba nnoh meh ti bu na agohsoh kwende, la mboh meh sa kpra Agohmoh ata nza a ka a sohroh a zuzuna kpeh. Ba nnoh meh kwende meh ti riri Nnoh ma aki ata nza a nati a zohhoh ŋoh, na nga agba tasa nyiri. <verse eid="HEB 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 12:29" />La Nnoh ambohroh reh a bu shira ata nza a ka a lofo reh.<verse eid="HEB 12:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HEB 13" />
  <para style="s">Ndohmoh Ata Nza Akuku Agohsoh ma Nnoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 13:1" />Rya nnoh tohmoh na kira nnoh na itoh amohnoh ika ata amboh tufa Kristi mboh reh. <verse eid="HEB 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 13:2" />Kama gu tsifa sa sene mboh ma afiya amohnoh reh te nnoh kohhroh kpeh. Amboh anyi tama a lisa dehreh maka a gǝga a sa mara tohmoh Nnoh mboh ma a wina kpeh. <verse eid="HEB 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 13:3" />Kohnoh nnoh na amboh ata nza ma a leh ma ida ka, tswanza mohnoh za ni bu noh na amoh reh. Kohnoh nnoh na amboh iya mboh tswanza mohnoh za ni bu noh amboh iya mboh ika ata amoh reh. <verse eid="HEB 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 13:4" />Nza nnoh tuma afya mboh ma atsifa ta a bu na rishi nimeh amohnoh nambri, atsifa mboh ma afya mata a kama a huru tsifa nimeh tuma amoh kpeh kanga. Nnoh a nati ahwra akpi ma amboh ata nza ma a hehndeh a leh ahohndoh na akyo ata nza a bu atsifa a ŋoh ha afya ŋoh kpeh tasa amboh hende chakafa tsifa mboh.<verse eid="HEB 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 13:5" />Kama gu ikpi amohnoh fi noh ma kira hungroh kpeh, andromboh ata nza ni bu na wohroh ta a tswa nnoh. Nnoh a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Meh nati sohroh ta nnoh kpeh; meh nati sohroh leke nnoh kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HEB 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 13:6" />Ba nnoh meh ti shi wuwana meh ti bleh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">&lt;&lt;Ada ka a shingi meh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 13:6">Meh nati sohroh nyiri kpeh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">A bu umbo kyangwri a nati a lisa meh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 13:7" />Kohnoh nnoh na agbugba amohnoh amboh jiji amboh ata ma ta ka a bleh noh tsifa Nnoh reh. Kohnoh nnoh na hende amoh tasa trina amoh reh, ti kǝ nza nyi nnoh na gya agohsoh amoh. <verse eid="HEB 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 13:8" />Yeso kristi reh a ka a sehneh kpeh, a bu ŋoh na mole, andrehmeh tasa ata tuma atono. <verse eid="HEB 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 13:9" />Kama kira tsana amboh anyi nambri mata a gu nnoh a hinga ma ikpi aki ata nza a bu yehlehleh kpeh. A zohhoh ti hunji noh wuwana ata nza anyi na lisa alindeh ata Nnoh reh, ta kama a bu ata akpi tsifa irya mboh kpeh; amboh ata nza ma a tufa tsifa amboh wohroh reh a sohroh a shingi mboh kpeh; amboh ata nza ma a tufa akpi amboh wohroh reh a sohroh a shingi mboh kpeh.<verse eid="HEB 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 13:10" />Firist amboh te ndohmoh nimeh atsi kwere Nnoh ata Yahudawa mboh reh, ma a sohroh a tswa mata a rya andromboh anyi nimeh awumu nga ata nana agohsoh ma atsi kwere ambohroh reh kpeh. <verse eid="HEB 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 13:11" />Agba Yahudawa amboh te ndohmoh ma ida Nnoh, ka a de imya ata uwo mboh aniye a na ma atsi ata nza a bu sehsehseh, ta a na na a nga ata nana agohsoh la ta a gu kpakpana kyangwri mboh; neh uwo mboh reh maka a fira a na na afya ma kpakpranda ma inziyo. <verse eid="HEB 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 13:12" />Dehreh za Yeso tana a kwo ma mgba inziyo akpo afya reh, la ta a lisa kyangwri mboh anyi ma kpakpana amoh na imya a ŋoh. <verse eid="HEB 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 13:13" />Nza a bu dehreh, ba nnoh meh ti na na a ŋoh ma mgba inziyo reh meh ti na ni wa isa na a ŋoh. <verse eid="HEB 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 13:14" />Mbohroh meh sohroh bu na akpo afya tuma atono anyi inziyo areh kpeh, Mbohroh meh fa akpo afya ata nza a nati a ba reh. <verse eid="HEB 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 13:15" />Nza a bu dehreh, meh ti kǝ kpa amumu riri Nnoh, wohroh ta a bu ngǝnga ata nana agohsoh ambohroh nimeh Yeso, wohroh a bu ngǝnga ata arimi ata nza a tsana la, ŋoh a bu Ada. <verse eid="HEB 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 13:16" />Kama gu tsifa lisa alindeh tasa shingi itoh amohnoh te nnoh kohhroh kpeh, la amboh wohroh ma a bu nga ata nza a ka a nana agohsoh ma Nnoh.<verse eid="HEB 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 13:17" />Sehreh nnoh na tsifa agbugba amohnoh mboh ti tufa nnoh tsifa amoh. Maka afo kpeh ma aki sumu nnoh, la mboh ma a nati a shi a bleh ndohmoh amoh ma tohmoh Nnoh. Nza ni tufa mboh nnoh, ma a nati a te ndohmoh amoh na agohsoh anyimbehreh; nza a bu dehreh kpeh, ma a nati a te na kputu agohsoh, wohroh reh a nati a sohroh a shingi nnoh kpeh.<verse eid="HEB 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 13:18" />Kǝ kwere turoh Nnoh. Agohsoh ambohroh a bu anyimbehreh ma la, meh kira meh ti lisa andromboh alindeh na tutu. <verse eid="HEB 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 13:19" />kavohshama kwere nnoh Nnoh la ta a gyuru a tohmoh meh a ba na amohnoh heri.<verse eid="HEB 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwere Nnoh Ata Trina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 13:20" />Ta Nnoh ata de tuma alindeh ba reh, ata nza a bu ma aki imya bleh gya ata tuma atono reh, ata nza a yiri Ada ambohroh reh Yeso anyi ma kwo, ŋoh nza a bu agba kyangwri sumu atashi, <verse eid="HEB 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 13:21" />ta nga noh awumu alilehndeh, ata nza a nati nga nnoh wuwana lisa andromboh ata ŋoh nza a kira, ta Yeso ta a shingi nnoh lisa andromboh ata nza a nati akuku agohsoh ma Nnoh. Yeso Kristi ta a hunji nga agba a na na a te ma trina ŋoh! Avoh dehreh. <verse eid="HEB 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 13:22" />Ambohroh amboh tufa mboh, meh kwere nnoh ti soh nnoh ivoh ma yira na tsifa amya reh, la meh zakǝ ŋa nnoh mgbiri amgbasho reh ma. <verse eid="HEB 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 13:23" />Meh kira meh ti bleh noh la, ma ata avoh ma atsi ambohroh Timoti anyi ma ida ka reh. Nza tana a ba fifi, meh nati wa ŋoh de ba na amohnoh.<verse eid="HEB 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 13:24" />Tsifa nnoh na agbugba amohnoh mboh nambri, tasa amboh tufa Nnoh mboh nambri. Amboh tufa mboh ma Italiya ma atsifa na amohnoh. <verse eid="HEB 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 13:25" />Alindeh ata Nnoh ta a bu na amohnoh nambri.<verse eid="HEB 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 13" />
</usx>